// IntroString :
"P3517934943" "How do you feel about doing some Arachnoid huntin' in the Gutter? They get so thick in there that we gotta cull 'em back sometime. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>If you're interested, you can head in and start thinning out the Arachnoids.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P611427571" "Cull Arachnoids in Gutter"
// SendOffString :
"P2251589842" "They can be cunning sometime, so watch out for ambushes!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2642255566" "You ain't killed enough Arachnoids yet. Get movin'!"

