// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P434298312" "Nice work, {VillainName}! That oughta thin their numbers a bit!<br><br>There's gotta be a better way of dealing with those critters.  Maybe some kind of new weapon..."
// RandomFameString :
"P856364347" ""

