// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2641048137" "Nice job cleaning out those Arachnoids in the Gutter. Y'know what I said about finding something to take out Arachnoids better? Well, I know Crey is always messing around with science and biology stuff. I heard from a buddy of mine that Crey's got a chemical research lab in Cap Au Diable where they just got in a shipment of heavy-duty pesticides, so maybe we can find something that'll do the trick against these Arachnoids. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Crey lab and see if you can find anything I can use against the Arachnoids.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3806965091" "Find chemical weapon in Crey lab"
// SendOffString :
"P1161527240" "Crey makes all kinds of great experimental weapons. Finding a good general purpose gas weapon would be great!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P630704021" "You hit that Crey lab yet? Get goin'!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3209999314" "There's gotta be something good Dobbs can use against the Arachnoids. Find it!"

