// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3099391022" "So... I really don't like the fact that Crey is messin' around with the Arachnoids. Sure, they're coming up with heavy-duty pesticides to control 'em, but they're also doin' other types of experiments. Now, the last thing we need is Crey letting loose a bunch of super-duper Arachnoids with extra cheese onto the world if you know what I mean!<br><br>Let's find out more about what Crey is up to! There's a Crey building on St. Martial near the Arachnoid caves which might give us a good clue as to what they're up to. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over there and ransack their files!</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P2216215510" "Find files on Crey experiments"
// SendOffString :
"P1046213011" "I ain't an espionage kinda guy, but this is probably worth lookin' into."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2011161745" "C'mon, {VillainName}. This is huge! Find those files at the Crey lab!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1002473832" "This Crey lab is in full alert. Find those files!"

