// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2297178574" "Okay, {VillainName}, we're getting' in WAY over our heads here! Getting in the way of Crey secret projects can get us killed! We gotta talk to Big Brother about this, and when I say that I mean Arachnos! I been told to talk to Arbiter Daos if I come across anything which 'compromises Arachnos security' or somethin', and I think this qualifies! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over and tell our predicament to Arbiter Daos!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1472199073" "Report to Arbiter Daos"
// SendOffString :
"P3653584444" "I'm washin' my hands of this, {VillainName}! You just talk to Daos and do what he says!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P22523005" "You talk with Daos yet? C'mon, the last thing I want is Crey corporate assassins comin' after us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1469131202" "<shout>You've stolen Crey secrets, {VillainName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2097372258" "Crey is performing experiments on Arachnoids? And you have proof of this? Very interesting.<br><br>Please inform Mr. Dobbs that this information is very useful to Arachnos, and we appreciate him bringing this to light. I'll begin preparations to counter this little Crey problem. I suggest you return to Mr. Dobbs to await further instructions. Thank you for your assistance. Remember our motto: Strength through Undying Loyalty."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1426494683" "Arachnos is getting' ready to act against Crey? Oh, man - I don't want to be caught in the middle of this!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission_6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P941933003" "I just got a call from Arbiter Daos - he says he wants you to lead a counterstrike against the main Crey facility involved in the experimentation with the Arachnoids! <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Head over to the Crey facility in Paragon City and take down the leader of the Arachnoid project!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P504490865" "Stop Crey Arachnoid research"
// SendOffString :
"P1014254654" "Daos said you're going to need to take down the Crey project leader and destroy the resarch they have. Best of luck to ya!"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3546919953" "What you waitin' for, {VillainName}? When Arachnos says jump, you gotta super-jump!"

